 <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#lahore">Lahore</a>, ending <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#ghaznavid-empire">Ghaznavid</a> rule</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1192</span><span class="rf-text">Mu'izz al-Din defeats <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#prithviraj-chauhan">Prithviraj Chauhan</a> at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#second-battle-of-tarain">Second Battle of Tarain</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1204</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#khwarazmshah">Khwarazmshah</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#qara-khitai">Qara Khitai</a> defeat Mu'izz al-Din at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#battle-of-andkhud">Andkhud</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1206</span><span class="rf-text">Mu'izz al-Din is assassinated; Qutb al-Din <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#aybak">Aybak</a> takes power at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#lahore">Lahore</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1215</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#khwarazmian-empire">Khwarazmian Empire</a> takes <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#ghazni">Ghazni</a>, ending Ghurid rule</span></li></ol>
